"Wi-Fi 正常连接且电量低于此值时，中央显示电量百分比。设为 0% 可关闭低电量自动显示；正在充电时仍优先显示电量；拔插电源或充电状态变化时仍会播放临时提示。" = "When Wi-Fi is connected and battery level is below this threshold, the center shows the battery percentage. Set 0% to disable this automatic display. Charging still takes priority; connecting or disconnecting power and charging state changes still show temporary hints.";
"主面板显示电量、电源来源、充电状态、当前充电上限、低电量模式和系统提供的粗略健康状态。能耗模式仅修改点击时的电源类型，需要管理员授权，退出 Combo 后保留。接电且确认被手动上限暂停充电时，可点击“立即充满电”；临时解除限制后的恢复由 macOS 管理，退出 Combo 不会取消。暂不支持仅优化充电暂缓的情况，无法操作时请使用系统电池设置。高耗能应用显示在主面板，可在活动监视器查看详细能耗。" = "The main panel shows battery level, power source, charging status, the active charge limit, Low Power Mode, and the system's approximate battery health. Energy mode changes apply only to the power source selected at click time, require administrator authorization, and remain after quitting Combo. When connected to power and charging is confirmed paused by a manual limit, click Charge to Full Now. macOS manages restoration after the temporary override; quitting Combo does not cancel it. Pauses caused only by optimized charging are not supported yet; use system Battery settings when this action is unavailable. High-energy apps appear in the main panel; Activity Monitor provides detailed energy information.";
