"概览固定显示 1 个；电池详情默认最多 1 个，按系统数据源顺序显示。没有高耗能应用时不补充其他应用，无法获取时会明确提示。" = "The overview always shows one app. Battery details default to at most one, in the system source's order. Other apps are not added when no high-energy apps are found; unavailable data is indicated explicitly.";
