"一步设置 · 授权由你决定" = "One Setup Step · Your Choice to Authorize";
"辅助功能是一项广泛的系统权限。Combo 用它读取系统设置中的三项勾选状态，并在正常退出时尝试恢复原状；实验性项目还可只读检查菜单栏访问；自动折叠已暂停。不截图或移动图标。" = "Accessibility is a broad system permission. Combo uses it to read the three checkbox states in System Settings and attempts to restore them on normal exit. Experiments can also inspect menu bar access without changing it. Automatic folding is paused. Combo does not take screenshots or move icons.";
"在辅助功能列表中开启 Combo" = "Enable Combo in the Accessibility List";
